---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import config from '../../site.config';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy and terms"
  description="Privacy policy and terms of use for carterfrenchbulls.com"
  noIndex={false}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <h1>Privacy and terms</h1>
        <p><em>Last updated: September 2026. PLACEHOLDER — review with a lawyer before launch.</em></p>

        <h2>Privacy policy</h2>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit the reservation request form, we collect your name, email address, phone number,
          country, and state or province. You may also share a message with us. We use this information
          only to respond to your inquiry and to follow up about a puppy.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell your information. We do not share it with third parties except for the
          email delivery service we use to forward your request to us ({config.kennelName}).
          We keep your information only as long as needed to complete the conversation.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This site does not use advertising cookies or third-party tracking cookies.
          We may use a session cookie to protect the contact form from automated spam.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You may ask us to delete any personal information you have shared with us.
          Contact us at {config.email !== '{{EMAIL}}' ? config.email : '[email — to be added]'} and we will
          respond within a reasonable time.
        </p>

        <hr style="margin: 48px 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);" />

        <h2>Terms of use</h2>
        <p>
          This website is operated by {config.kennelName}. By using this site, you agree to these terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
        <p>
          We make reasonable efforts to keep puppy listings, prices, and availability up to date.
          Listings are subject to change without notice. Confirming details directly with us before
          making any decisions is always the right move.
        </p>

        <h2>No guarantees</h2>
        <p>
          Viewing a listing on this site does not reserve a puppy. A puppy is held only after a
          deposit is received and a written agreement is signed.
        </p>

        <h2>No liability</h2>
        <p>
          {config.kennelName} is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential
          damages arising from your use of this site or from the purchase of a puppy.
          This does not limit any statutory rights you may have as a consumer.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms or our privacy practices? Reach us at{' '}
          {config.email !== '{{EMAIL}}' ? (
            <a href={`mailto:${config.email}`}>{config.email}</a>
          ) : (
            '[email — to be added]'
          )}.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 68ch;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
  }
</style>
